      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1735997724410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data Management in MicroService\n- DB for each individual service\n    - SAGA - Sequence of Local transaction \n        - type 1 - Choreography\n        - type 2 - Orchestrator \n    - CQRS - Command Query Request Segregation\n        - Command - Create, Update, Delete\n        - Query - Select \n- Shared DB\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data Management in MicroService\n- DB for each individual service\n    - SAGA - Sequence of Local transaction \n        - type 1 - Choreography\n        - type 2 - Orchestrator \n    - CQRS - Command Query Request Segregation\n        - Command - Create, Update, Delete\n        - Query - Select \n- Shared DB\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
