      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Single Server -> \n2. Application & DB layer seperation -> \n3. Bringing Load-Balancer and Multiple App servers ->\n4. DB Replication (Master - Slave) ->\n5. Cache (Performance improvement) -> \n6. CDN -> \n7. DataCenters -> \n8. Messaging Queue (RabbitMQ, Kafka) ->\n9. DB Scaling (Horizontal->Sharding, Vertical)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Single Server -> \n2. Application & DB layer seperation -> \n3. Bringing Load-Balancer and Multiple App servers ->\n4. DB Replication (Master - Slave) ->\n5. Cache (Performance improvement) -> \n6. CDN -> \n7. DataCenters -> \n8. Messaging Queue (RabbitMQ, Kafka) ->\n9. DB Scaling (Horizontal->Sharding, Vertical)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
